        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/koga/{size}/2058_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-07T05:38:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><a href=\"http://co.perfectworld.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://co.perfectworld.com</a></p><p>I've seen at least one other person here that plays Champions Online. Figured I'd post this to see who else plays, maybe we could group up in-game on some missions. CO is a great place to take screenshots for custom heroes, especially if you got a freeform character. I have a Lifetime Membership myself so I play the game from time to time, especially when making a new character for SotM.</p><p>My handle in CO is Koga_Wolfe. Send a friend invite if you want.</p><p>I also created a chat channel for us so we don't have to be in same Supergroup to chat together.<br>Channel name: SotM</p><p>Sentinels was taken already and Sentinels of the Multiverse was too long to fit.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:36:39.358Z",
