        "raw": "<p><a href=\"http://co.perfectworld.com\">http://co.perfectworld.com</a></p><p>I&#39;ve seen at least one other person here that plays Champions Online. Figured I&#39;d post this to see who else plays, maybe we could group up in-game on some missions. CO is a great place to take screenshots for custom heroes, especially if you got a freeform character. I have a Lifetime Membership myself so I play the game from time to time, especially when making a new character for SotM.</p><p>My handle in CO is Koga_Wolfe. Send a friend invite if you want.</p><p>I also created a chat channel for us so we don&#39;t have to be in same Supergroup to chat together.<br />Channel name: SotM</p><p>Sentinels was taken already and Sentinels of the Multiverse was too long to fit.</p>",
